      "writtenOn": "2024-05-28T10:22:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the name of this property can be improved. Profiles provided through `profile` are also baseline profiles, so adding another property called `baseline_profile` can confuse users.\n\nGiven the main difference between `profile` and the new property is that profiles provided through the new property are to be processed by r8 before used, consider names like `unobfuscated_profile`.\n\nAlternatively, replace this string property with a boolean, say, `is_profile_unobfuscated`. When it\u0027s set to true, process `profile` with r8 before using. This can also address Jihoon\u0027s concern about both string properties being set.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 169,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 169,
        "endChar": 18
      },
      "revId": "e8066eb3e473b6a75e4b17de93d44c4242375b99",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f37cc31a_c4dce2da",
        "filename": "java/dexpreopt.go",
        "patchSetId": 3
